{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39692","headline":"经安州感故郑郎中二首 二 · 黄滔","name":"经安州感故郑郎中二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦帐先生作牧州，干戈缺後见荒丘。\n兼无姓贾儿童在，空有还珠烟水流。\n江句行人吟刻石，月肠是处象登楼。\n旅魂频此归来否，千载云山属一游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39692.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39692","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}